  "instructions": [
    "Preheat the oven to 400°F (200°C).",
    "Toss the cauliflower florets with 1 tbsp of coconut oil, salt, and pepper on a baking sheet.",
    "Roast in the oven for 20 minutes or until tender.",
    "In a large pan, heat the remaining 1 tbsp of coconut oil over medium heat.",
    "Add the chickpeas and cook until lightly browned, about 5 minutes.",
    "Stir in the fermented kimchi, dried cranberries, and pumpkin seeds.",
    "Cook for an additional 2 minutes.",
    "Stir in the lemon juice and speculaas spice mix.",
    "Season with salt and pepper to taste.",
    "To assemble the bowls, place a scoop of the chickpea-kimchi mixture in the dolsot stone bowl.",
    "Top with roasted cauliflower florets and chopped cilantro.",
    "Serve immediately and enjoy!"
  ],
